description	"Captain Riiken

A mobile royal quartermaster with many requisitioned weaponry. 

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Specialty Vibrocutlass (Yellow/Cyan)
-- Saber Defense (1)
--- BP-Free Jumps
-- No Blaster Block
-- 18% more knockback
-- 16% less Yellow damage
-- 35% shorter
- Handcrafted Six Shooter (3)
-- Blaster Pistol
-- 5% more charged FP damage/Damage/Velocity
-- 50%+ RoF
-- 6 Shots, Mag Reload
- Frag Grenades (2)
-- Burns on det

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Armor Regen (1)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS3]
- Grappling Hook/Hop (2) ^3[Melee CS4]
-- Pulls/staggers on hit"